+- Removing a user from an org (`DELETE /orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}`) is for org
+  admins of that org only. Other members get 403; an org other than the
+  caller's, or a user not in that org, → 404. It deletes the user's memberships
+  in the org's projects, including archived ones (offboarding must not be
+  blocked by archiving), and unassigns the tasks the user held there, so an
+  assignee is always a member of the task's project. It is all-or-nothing, and
+  repeating it is a no-op that still returns 204. The user's own org
+  (`users.org_id`) is not changed.
 
